; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐1‐4
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:6_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:翌日的早餐时间，<br>我、蕾雅、奈叶香，还有一人——|#0201Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚也加入了我们。|#0201Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:说来，这真是意料之外的组合呢。|#0201Adv09_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:迅速结束用餐的蕾雅<br>略带惊讶地说道。|#0201Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我本以为像希罗这样的类型<br>应该会讨厌自由奔放的人。|#0201Adv09_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:越是自由的人，越需要让她学会规矩。|#0201Adv09_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:同样快速吃完早餐的我，<br>一边品着餐后红茶一边优雅地说道。|#0201Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今早她又想乱涂乱画了。<br>需要对她彻底管教——不，是需要教育。|#0201Adv09_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:换个说法也没有本质区别啊……|#0201Adv09_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:气气。|#0201Adv09_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚一脸不开心，用叉子戳着盘中的谜之食物。<br>时不时还自顾自地让食物蠕动起来玩耍。|#0201Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香则一直在凝神观察着这一幕。|#0201Adv09_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你的魔法是操纵液体，对吧。|#0201Adv09_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:对呀。诺亚的魔法就是让画自己动起来。<br>只要是液体，都能让它动起来哦。|#0201Adv09_Noah002| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:不过只能对画起作用啦。看！|#0201Adv09_Noah003| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那团扭曲的食物<br>变成了一条立体的艺术蛇。完成度相当高。|#0201Adv09_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Noah Category:Profile Version:9

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚得意洋洋地挺起胸膛，<br>但蕾雅的表情却不太好看。|#0201Adv09_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她突然低下头，悄悄说道。|#0201Adv09_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

; ＠備考◆内緒話

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我已经猜想到了<br>大家都有神奇的力量——魔法，<br>但是，公开这些信息可能不太妥当吧。|#0201Adv09_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？为什么？|#0201Adv09_Noah004| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:……我也赞同莲见蕾雅的意见。<br>不暴露底牌才是明智的做法。|#0201Adv09_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ひとりごと風にぼそりと

[PrintTextModified Text:考虑到接下来可能发生的事，更是如此。|#0201Adv09_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv09_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我并不这么认为。|#0201Adv09_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果彼此之间互相隐藏手牌，<br>必然会产生嫌隙。|#0201Adv09_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然知道有魔法存在，<br>那么共享彼此的信息反而更容易合作。|#0201Adv09_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，我自己也没打算向任何人透露<br>我拥有【死亡回溯】的魔法，更不打算使用它。|#0201Adv09_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我保持沉默。|#0201Adv09_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:环顾四周，其他被囚禁的少女们<br>大致以与昨晚相同的组合用餐。亚里沙不在。|#0201Adv09_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:视线扫到艾玛，我不快地皱起眉头。|#0201Adv09_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛、雪莉和汉娜三人像是在密谋一般，<br>不知道在商量什么。|#0201Adv09_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:不能向别人展示魔法吗？<br>但是，诺亚只要一画画，<br>就全都是用魔法了啊。气气。|#0201Adv09_Noah005| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚又开始一脸不开心起来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不是答应过你吗。<br>今天要为你找个画画的地方。|#0201Adv09_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:对哦！<br>诺亚我呀，要和希罗一起出去玩啦！|#0201Adv09_Noah006| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ご機嫌

[PrintTextModified Text:出去玩～，出去玩～♪<br>画画～，画画～♪|#0201Adv09_Noah007| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好了，快点吃吧。<br>我在等你吃完呢。|#0201Adv09_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我帮诺亚擦拭她嘴角沾上的食物。<br>蕾雅微笑着眺望我们两人。|#0201Adv09_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:……你们现在这么亲密了呀。<br>希罗的行动力真是令人佩服。|#0201Adv09_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这人说话怎么这么浮夸。算了）|#0201Adv09_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在等诺亚的时候，<br>我突然想到了什么，站起身来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:——大家请注意！！|#0201Adv09_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我提高嗓门，食堂里的少女们<br>都看向我这边。|#0201Adv09_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都带手机来了吗？<br>我昨晚也研究了一下。|#0201Adv09_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我举起自己的手机给大家看。|#0201Adv09_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来手机里装有可以聊天的APP。<br>只要交换ID，以后就可以随时传信息了。<br>应该还能语音通话。|#0201Adv09_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然，聊天内容被那只猫头鹰监听的可能性极高……<br>不过考虑到我们本就是被软禁在此，<br>也没必要想太多。|#0201Adv09_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟还有限制活动的时间，<br>我们应该好好利用这个聊天功能。<br>现在，我们所有人互换联系方式吧。|#0201Adv09_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，确实是个好主意。<br>所有人互换联系方式……是我没能说出口的主意。|#0201Adv09_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅虽然脸上略带遗憾，<br>仍然还是飒爽地站到我身边。|#0201Adv09_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:本来我因为和大家还不太熟络，所以多少有些顾忌，<br>但困难当前，我也不能再这么下去了。<br>还请各位踊跃和我交换联系方式！|#0201Adv09_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她怎么回事，一举一动都跟演戏似的……<br>　算了，不说什么了）|#0201Adv09_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女们似乎也没什么异议，<br>纷纷查看手机，开始互加好友。|#0201Adv09_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（明天再问亚里沙要联系方式就行了）|#0201Adv09_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边进行这仪式般的举动，<br>一边在脑子里想好了接下来的计划。|#0201Adv09_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，视野角落里出现了一个令人在意的少女。|#0201Adv09_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:是佐伯米莉亚。<br>她低着头，似乎想尽可能地消除自己的存在感。|#0201Adv09_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我朝她走了过去。|#0201Adv09_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚。我想和你交换联系方式。|#0201Adv09_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR4,ArmL3
; ＠備考◆ぎくりと肩を揺らす
@EmoteJump ActorIds:Miria Loop:false Speed:1
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0201Adv09_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR4,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:……那个，这是一定要交换、的吗……？<br>大叔我，对这些东西不太擅长……|#0201Adv09_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:一定要的。我并不打算和你搞好关系。<br>只是，接下来会发生什么事，谁也说不准。<br>每个人都互相保持联系会比较好。|#0201Adv09_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 備考◆自分に言い聞かせる

[PrintTextModified Text:是这样啊……啊哈哈，输给你了……<br>说、说得也是啊。并不是朋友之间的交流，<br>而是类似工作联络那样的东西吧，嗯。|#0201Adv09_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚虽然有些不太情愿，但还是拿出手机，<br>加入了互加好友的仪式。|#0201Adv09_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——终于，除了亚里沙以外的所有人都加上了联系方式，<br>大多数少女都离开了食堂。|#0201Adv09_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，蕾雅再次低下头，压低声音说道。|#0201Adv09_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL1

; 備考◆内緒話

[PrintTextModified Text:——话说希罗、奈叶香、诺亚。<br>能借一步说话吗。|#0201Adv09_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么事？|#0201Adv09_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:你们觉得今后会发生【凶杀案】吗？|#0201Adv09_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_162 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.25

[PrintTextModified Text:——凶杀案。<br>这个词，让我的心猛地一跳。|#0201Adv09_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……应该要考虑到这种可能性吧。|#0201Adv09_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我假装平静地说道。<br>奈叶香也深深点头。|#0201Adv09_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。我认为会发生。|#0201Adv09_Nanoka004| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚不知道，<br>但是诺亚讨厌杀人犯。因为很可怕。|#0201Adv09_Noah008| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。虽然我希望相信这种事不会发生，<br>但为了保险起见，我们要不要先定下一些规矩？|#0201Adv09_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……定下规矩，是指？|#0201Adv09_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果发生凶杀案，举行魔女审判的话，<br>每个囚犯都要投票决出谁是魔女。|#0201Adv09_Leia011| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，我们四个人绝对不能<br>投票给自己人，这样如何。|#0201Adv09_Leia012| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:我想相信同伴。相信我们之间的牵绊。|#0201Adv09_Leia013| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是为了自保，还是出于天真？很难判断……）|#0201Adv09_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……虽然是个不错的想法，但我不能赞同。|#0201Adv09_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……为、为什么？|#0201Adv09_Leia014| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使是同伴，如果真的犯下了杀人罪行，<br>那么，那个人就应该受到惩罚。|#0201Adv09_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果真的认为对方是同伴，就更应该这么做。<br>如果是我的话，为了让那个人改过自新，我会这么做的。|#0201Adv09_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗。虽然有点遗憾，<br>但也许希罗说得对……|#0201Adv09_Leia015| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我明白了，忘了我说的吧！<br>我们之间就保持公平吧！|#0201Adv09_Leia016| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:就在蕾雅果断发出宣言的片刻后。|#0201Adv09_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

; ボイス加工：部屋の外
; ＠備考◆絶叫

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊啊啊——！！|#0201Adv09_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听见食堂外传来的尖叫，<br>我们表情僵硬地站了起来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那声音昭示着监牢中发生了可怕的事情，<br>我们慌忙跑出食堂。|#0201Adv09_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
