[PrintTextModified Text:刚出走廊，<br>我就亲眼目睹了那个场景，不禁战栗。|#0201Adv09_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守正挥舞着镰刀<br>朝少女们砍去。|#0201Adv09_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

