[PrintTextModified Text:每当镰刀划出轨迹，<br>就有一件走廊上的陈设被劈成两半。|#0201Adv09_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Jailer-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:15 ScenePositionY:8 Scale:1.4
