[PrintTextModified Text:无论是硬木还是金属，<br>在看守的镰刀下全都只消一击就被腰斩。|#0201Adv09_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Jailer-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:85 ScenePositionY:8 Scale:1.4
