[PrintTextModified Text:那把镰刀的威胁性再明显不过了。|#0201Adv09_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1,Angle01/Option_Arms-
