@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:不仅是我，<br>走廊上所有的少女都害怕得发抖。|#0201Adv09_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，啊……啊。|#0201Adv09_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住、住手吧！！|#0201Adv09_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是我们错了……！|#0201Adv09_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

