; ゴクチョーのボイス
; ＠ゴクチョー

[PrintTextModified Text:快住手！我不允许这么做！|#0201Adv09_Unknown001| AuthorId:Unknown RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:一声威严斥责响起，让所有人为之一震。<br>我本以为是典狱长出现，制止了看守的暴行。|#0201Adv09_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:看向声音来处，站在那里的却是玛格。|#0201Adv09_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是她的魔法吗……！）|#0201Adv09_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:看守也像是回应典狱长的声音一般——<br>朝那个方向挥下镰刀。|#0201Adv09_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Jailer-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:85 ScenePositionY:8 Scale:1.4
