; ＠備考◆鎌で切りつけられて

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊啊啊！|#0201Adv09_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:0.3 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格！！|#0201Adv09_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——血沫四溅，<br>过道一片狼藉。|#0201Adv09_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv09_Jailer002| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ＠備考◆重傷で苦しげ

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……呜呜……|#0201Adv09_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然玛格没有当场死亡，<br>但她的腰侧似乎被深深砍了一刀。|#0201Adv09_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:鲜血不停涌出，染红了过道。|#0201Adv09_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我比任何人都更深切地感受过看守的可怕。<br>全身的血液都仿佛瞬间冻结。|#0201Adv09_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,35 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格小姐……|#0201Adv09_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露立刻奔向玛格身边，<br>双手轻轻放在伤口上。<br>梅露露掌心绽放出光芒。是魔法。|#0201Adv09_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Meruru Category:Profile Version:5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,35 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，啊啊，怎么会受这么重的伤……<br>我不要这样，不可以，绝对不会让你丧命的……|#0201Adv09_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:坚持住，玛格小姐……！|#0201Adv09_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆重傷で苦しげ

[PrintTextModified Text:我本想保护大家的……<br>结果自己却中招了，真是活该呢……呃！|#0201Adv09_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请不要说话……<br>我会治好你的，请你一定要撑住……！|#0201Adv09_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv09_Jailer003| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看守凝视着玛格的方向，不知在沉思些什么。<br>良久，终于静静离开了现场。|#0201Adv09_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:危机暂时解除，<br>少女们之间紧绷的神经终于也稍稍放松。|#0201Adv09_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:到底发生了什么事！？|#0201Adv09_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我气势汹汹地抓住了附近的艾玛的衣领。|#0201Adv09_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR19,ArmL14
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……那个……我们，<br>商量着要越狱。|#0201Adv09_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我、雪莉和汉娜三个人，<br>就行动了……|#0201Adv09_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是的……我昨天也说过，<br>我有怪力魔法。|#0201Adv09_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我们商量着<br>用魔法让看守昏迷，<br>然后大家一起逃跑。|#0201Adv09_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:结果我们袭击看守的时候，<br>好像惹怒了它，<br>它就开始挥舞镰刀……|#0201Adv09_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:愚蠢至极！|#0201Adv09_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请、请不要这么大声呵斥我们……！<br>我们也没想到会变成这样……|#0201Adv09_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女看起来没有受伤。|#0201Adv09_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们可没听说过<br>看守那么强大，那么可怕呀……|#0201Adv09_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我以为靠自己的怪力能打倒它，<br>真是太天真了……|#0201Adv09_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，都是我们的错，害得玛格……|#0201Adv09_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们完全蔫了，眼中含着泪水。|#0201Adv09_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1,ArmR4,ArmL3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Fearful1,ArmL8
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:75 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:可可、米莉亚和安安也挤在过道的角落里，<br>脸色苍白地发抖。|#0201Adv09_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真的不行了，太恶心了……呜，要吐了……|#0201Adv09_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好可怕……这里，太可怕了……|#0201Adv09_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那么多血……我不舒服……|#0201Adv09_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:第一次有少女遭受如此残酷的对待，<br>走廊的气氛变得阴郁起来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:——你们是害怕血的红色吗？|#0201Adv09_Noah009| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知何时诺亚出现在了现场。|#0201Adv09_Narrative058| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚疑惑地歪着头，<br>环视着少女们的样子。|#0201Adv09_Narrative059| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，诺亚要把所有的红色，<br>都变得不可怕哦！|#0201Adv09_Noah010| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（难道——）|#0201Adv09_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:心中闪过预感的同时。|#0201Adv09_Narrative060| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,20 AppearanceAndTransition:110_1

; カラースプレーを吸い込む音（魔法）
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_113 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_34_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚挥起手，<br>将飞溅的血液聚集到手边，做成了一支彩色的笔。|#0201Adv09_Narrative061| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:用诺亚的魔法，<br>所有所有血的红色，都变成蝴蝶的图画吧～！|#0201Adv09_Noah011| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:110_1

; 魔法少女っぽいキラキラ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_114 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@StopSfx
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_114 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:在目瞪口呆的我们面前，<br>大量的蝴蝶图案突然飞舞起来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative062| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仿佛是梦幻般的魔法，<br>整个世界变得五彩缤纷。|#0201Adv09_Narrative063| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:令人难以置信的景象。|#0201Adv09_Narrative064| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露对玛格施展治愈魔法已经足够称得上奇迹了，<br>但这比奇迹更让人震惊。|#0201Adv09_Narrative065| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:用了很～多力量的。<br>这是特别的魔法哦～|#0201Adv09_Noah012| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从今以后所有人<br>流出的血都会变成蝴蝶图案哦。|#0201Adv09_Noah013| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了让大家不再害怕！|#0201Adv09_Noah014| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚努力了！<br>怎么样？厉害吗？厉害吗？|#0201Adv09_Noah015| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Duration:0.5 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽、虽然很厉害，<br>但这有什么意义呢……？|#0201Adv09_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？倒是没有什么意义呢？<br>只是血会变成蝴蝶图案而已哦。|#0201Adv09_Noah016| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是这样啊……|#0201Adv09_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚笑嘻嘻的，但突然意识到什么，<br>转向我。她的表情有点尴尬。|#0201Adv09_Narrative066| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……诺亚画画了。会被骂吗……？|#0201Adv09_Noah017| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……并不是在生你的气。<br>只是因为问题还没解决而已。|#0201Adv09_Hiro028| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。我记得这里好像有医务室。<br>我们把玛格带到医务室去吧。|#0201Adv09_Leia017| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅飒爽地飞奔到玛格身边，<br>轻松将她横抱起来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative067| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:需要有人护理。我也来帮忙。<br>还有，那边的梅露露。|#0201Adv09_Hiro029| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我在……|#0201Adv09_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你似乎有治愈魔法，<br>希望你和我们一起照料她。|#0201Adv09_Hiro030| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当、当然了……|#0201Adv09_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我迅速下达指示，<br>和蕾雅并肩走了起来。|#0201Adv09_Narrative068| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv09_Hiro031| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚迈出的脚步停顿了一下。<br>我回头看向艾玛。|#0201Adv09_Narrative069| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:不要再想越狱这种愚蠢的事了。|#0201Adv09_Hiro032| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:……真的很对不起……|#0201Adv09_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我很生气。<br>比起对任何人，我最恨自己不争。|#0201Adv09_Narrative070| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果我能更强烈警告大家看守的危险程度，<br>　这场事故本来是可以避免的）|#0201Adv09_Hiro033|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（而且，<br>　知道看守到底有多危险的，只有我）|#0201Adv09_Hiro034|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（绝不能再让这样的事情发生——！）|#0201Adv09_Hiro035| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

